Description: Keep the CamillaDSP FIFO frame-aligned when the IO thread is cancelled
 snd_pcm_drop() pthread_cancels the IO thread from cdsp_stop(). write() is a
 cancellation point, so a cancel mid-period leaves a sub-frame byte count in
 the FIFO and CamillaDSP then reads a permanently misaligned stream.
 Disable cancellation across one whole period write.
 .
 Apply after debug_level.patch and fix_make_clean.patch.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/bitkeeper/alsa_cdsp/pull/2
Forwarded: https://github.com/bitkeeper/alsa_cdsp/pull/2
Author: Mike Ovsiannikov <mike1@yahoo.com>
Last-Update: 2026-09-26

